00:08:54.412 --> 00:09:05.043
<v News>農林水産省は、毎週、全国のスーパーのコメの価格を調べて、発表しています。

00:09:05.744 --> 00:09:09.775
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:22.063
<v Slow>8月9日までの1週間、スーパーで売られたコメの平均価格は、5キロあたりいくらでしたか。

00:09:22.864 --> 00:09:25.768
<v Host>Three thousand two hundred twenty yen.

00:09:26.368 --> 00:09:32.440
<v Slow>コメの値段が上がったのは、何週間ぶりですか。

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:35.735
<v Host>For the first time in seven weeks.

00:09:36.336 --> 00:09:45.456
<v Slow>専門家は、今年の新米の値段はいくらぐらいになると予想していますか。

00:09:46.255 --> 00:09:49.687
<v Host>Around three thousand yen for five kilograms.

00:09:50.288 --> 00:10:00.895
<v Host>That's all for today. Rice prices touch everyday life in Japan, so this weekly number gets a lot of attention. Thank you for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:10:01.495 --> 00:10:03.895
<v News>また明日。
